{\plain {\b0 \fs20 The above discussion 
is illustrative of an important use of high-level
 mathematical software. A signal processing
 algorithm may be }{\fs20 \b0 \b0 \fs20 
implemented, studied and understood}{\fs20 
\b0  relatively quickly. Then the algorithm
 may be translated into the much lower level
 language that  will be used in the actual
 application. This lower level language 
is efficient computationally but a laborious
 and opaque algorithm development environment!}}
}
